      "text": "A bar chart comparing facility reports (light red) with survey estimates (dark red, with error bars) by year, on a y-axis from 80 to 100. Facility reports: 88 (2009), 93 (2010), 94 (2011), 95 (2012). Survey: 88 (2009) and 95 (2011); no survey in 2010 or 2012. The quantity measured is not named in the image.",
